This distribution includes the VAPOR research attention implementation and
new packaging, model adapters, and examples. It is licensed under Apache-2.0.

The code integrates with PyTorch, Transformers, Triton, Qwen3-VL, and InternVL.
Their packages, remote model code, and pretrained weights are not redistributed
here and remain subject to their respective licenses. The InternVL image example
follows the model's published image tiling and conversation-template conventions.

External comparison methods, including VisionPulse, are separate works and
are not included as VAPOR implementation code.
